; Melange build of test/browser (.ai/asm_plan.md M5, the real-browser
; harness). Same sources, copied rather than duplicated; see melange/dune for
; why the tree is mirrored at all.
;
; Deliberately no wrapping library here, and deliberately only [smoke] named
; in [melange.emit]'s [(modules ...)] - never [smoke_native]/[smoke_jsoo]:
; a module cannot belong to both a library stanza and a melange.emit stanza
; in the same file ("Module ... is used in several stanzas"), and the two
; native-only entry points have no Melange counterpart to begin with (no
; Js.export needed on this side - see smoke.ml's own header comment and
; asm/melange/test/dump/dune's identical asm_dump/manifest_dump precedent,
; where melange.emit compiles the driver modules directly). CommonJS emission
; exposes [run] as [module.exports.run] automatically.

(copy_files#
 (files ../../../test/browser/*.ml))

(melange.emit
 (target js)
 (modules smoke)
 (module_systems commonjs)
 (libraries
  foundation
  image
  target_intf
  driver
  test_dump_inputs
  smoke_fixtures)
 (enabled_if
  (= %{env:ASM_MELANGE=false} true)))
